  "content": [
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:24 AM",
      "text": "Do you think there’s any chance they’d let you step into the rotation if you only get like one appearance? They could put you at the back and get you a couple"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "10:49 AM",
      "text": "Yeah I think so"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:43 PM",
      "text": "I asked Gardy that today. You gotta get to camp"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "1:44 PM",
      "text": "What did he say"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:44 PM",
      "text": "Between the lines, that"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:44 PM",
      "text": "That you gotta get to camp and throw there"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "1:44 PM",
      "text": "No doubt"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:44 PM",
      "text": "The system is screwing you"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:44 PM",
      "text": "But it’s funny because he always talks about how you’re probably staying in shape"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "1:44 PM",
      "text": "What else is new"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:45 PM",
      "text": "And I know they know what you’ve been doing"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "1:45 PM",
      "text": "I am. They know I’m ready. Just gotta get cleared"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:45 PM",
      "text": "And I know too"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:45 PM",
      "text": "😂"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "1:45 PM",
      "text": "I’ve told them"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:45 PM",
      "text": "Couple guys got cleared last two days, so maybe that’s good news"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "1:45 PM",
      "text": "Yea I saw that"
    }
  ]
}